{"id":"vol9-02","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/vol9-02/audio-3.m4a","model":"small","duration":401.52,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":7.44,"text":"Part 3. You will hear two business students called Emma and Nick preparing for their presentation","words":[["Part",0.0,0.16],["3.",0.16,0.54],["You",1.44,2.04],["will",2.04,2.24],["hear",2.24,2.56],["two",2.56,2.92],["business",2.92,3.3],["students",3.3,3.8],["called",3.8,4.3],["Emma",4.3,4.66],["and",4.66,5.06],["Nick",5.06,5.36],["preparing",5.36,6.38],["for",6.38,6.68],["their",6.68,6.86],["presentation",6.86,7.44]]},{"start":7.44,"end":14.62,"text":"on the topic of How Jobs Might Change in the Future. First you have some time to look at","words":[["on",7.44,7.96],["the",7.96,8.08],["topic",8.08,8.42],["of",8.42,8.68],["How",8.68,9.34],["Jobs",9.34,9.88],["Might",9.88,10.2],["Change",10.2,10.64],["in",10.64,10.96],["the",10.96,11.08],["Future.",11.08,11.36],["First",12.46,13.18],["you",13.18,13.4],["have",13.4,13.56],["some",13.56,13.74],["time",13.74,14.12],["to",14.12,14.34],["look",14.34,14.48],["at",14.48,14.62]]},{"start":14.62,"end":51.23,"text":"questions 21 to 24. Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 24.","words":[["questions",14.62,14.94],["21",14.94,15.7],["to",15.7,16.02],["24.",16.02,16.58],["Now",47.27,47.55],["listen",47.55,47.91],["carefully",47.91,48.35],["and",48.35,48.73],["answer",48.73,49.09],["questions",49.09,49.45],["21",49.45,50.35],["to",50.35,50.65],["24.",50.65,51.23]]},{"start":54.88,"end":61.72,"text":"Okay Nick, the title of our presentation is How Jobs Might Change in the Future. Shall","words":[["Okay",54.88,55.3],["Nick,",55.3,55.56],["the",55.92,56.14],["title",56.14,56.56],["of",56.56,56.76],["our",56.76,56.88],["presentation",56.88,57.32],["is",57.32,58.06],["How",58.06,58.46],["Jobs",58.46,58.88],["Might",58.88,59.2],["Change",59.2,59.62],["in",59.62,59.98],["the",59.98,60.1],["Future.",60.1,60.42],["Shall",61.26,61.72]]},{"start":61.72,"end":63.74,"text":"So we look at the research we've done so far.","words":[["So",61.72,61.78],["we",61.78,61.86],["look",61.86,62.02],["at",62.02,62.14],["the",62.14,62.24],["research",62.24,62.7],["we've",62.7,63.02],["done",63.02,63.14],["so",63.14,63.36],["far.",63.36,63.74]]},{"start":64.26,"end":66.64,"text":"I was just watching an interview with Alex Coburn.","words":[["I",64.26,64.42],["was",64.42,64.54],["just",64.54,64.74],["watching",64.74,65.08],["an",65.08,65.28],["interview",65.28,65.58],["with",65.58,65.8],["Alex",65.8,66.1],["Coburn.",66.1,66.64]]},{"start":67.1,"end":67.52,"text":"Go on.","words":[["Go",67.1,67.26],["on.",67.26,67.52]]},{"start":67.92,"end":72.1,"text":"He talked about a company with a call centre for dealing with complaints.","words":[["He",67.92,68.18],["talked",68.18,68.6],["about",68.6,69.06],["a",69.06,69.26],["company",69.26,69.62],["with",69.62,70.04],["a",70.04,70.2],["call",70.2,70.44],["centre",70.44,70.86],["for",70.86,71.12],["dealing",71.12,71.46],["with",71.46,71.66],["complaints.",71.66,72.1]]},{"start":72.82,"end":78.5,"text":"Instead of following a script with a list of questions they had to ask, the call centre","words":[["Instead",72.82,73.24],["of",73.24,73.46],["following",73.46,73.68],["a",73.68,73.92],["script",73.92,74.36],["with",74.36,75.1],["a",75.1,75.24],["list",75.24,75.46],["of",75.46,75.62],["questions",75.62,76.02],["they",76.02,76.3],["had",76.3,76.6],["to",76.6,76.78],["ask,",76.78,77.24],["the",77.72,77.88],["call",77.88,78.2],["centre",78.2,78.5]]},{"start":78.5,"end":83.12,"text":"employees were told they could deal with complaints however they wanted, which went","words":[["employees",78.5,79.02],["were",79.02,79.24],["told",79.24,79.46],["they",79.46,79.66],["could",79.66,79.8],["deal",79.8,80.12],["with",80.12,80.34],["complaints",80.34,80.92],["however",80.92,81.26],["they",81.26,81.7],["wanted,",81.7,82.04],["which",82.66,82.94],["went",82.94,83.12]]},{"start":83.12,"end":83.96,"text":"down well with them.","words":[["down",83.12,83.34],["well",83.34,83.54],["with",83.54,83.76],["them.",83.76,83.96]]},{"start":84.48,"end":86.64,"text":"That's not a common approach these days.","words":[["That's",84.48,84.94],["not",84.94,85.08],["a",85.08,85.24],["common",85.24,85.56],["approach",85.56,85.94],["these",85.94,86.3],["days.",86.3,86.64]]},{"start":86.86,"end":88.2,"text":"But apparently it worked.","words":[["But",86.86,87.02],["apparently",87.02,87.54],["it",87.54,87.82],["worked.",87.82,88.2]]},{"start":89.2,"end":90.84,"text":"Customers were happier with the new methods.","words":[["Customers",89.2,89.48],["were",89.48,89.62],["happier",89.62,89.92],["with",89.92,90.2],["the",90.2,90.34],["new",90.34,90.5],["methods.",90.5,90.84]]},{"start":90.84,"end":97.88,"text":"Really? That's certainly not the result you'd expect. We'll definitely have to use that example.","words":[["Really?",90.84,91.94],["That's",92.62,93.2],["certainly",93.2,93.52],["not",93.52,93.84],["the",93.84,94.0],["result",94.0,94.34],["you'd",94.34,94.54],["expect.",94.54,94.9],["We'll",95.62,95.98],["definitely",95.98,96.4],["have",96.4,96.78],["to",96.78,96.94],["use",96.94,97.16],["that",97.16,97.38],["example.",97.38,97.88]]},{"start":98.22,"end":98.54,"text":"Maybe.","words":[["Maybe.",98.22,98.54]]},{"start":99.44,"end":105.54,"text":"What about Jerry Kaplan's report? He argues there'll be plenty of jobs not suitable for machines.","words":[["What",99.44,99.84],["about",99.84,100.14],["Jerry",100.14,100.58],["Kaplan's",100.58,101.34],["report?",101.34,101.62],["He",102.28,102.5],["argues",102.5,102.96],["there'll",102.96,103.34],["be",103.34,103.48],["plenty",103.48,103.82],["of",103.82,104.04],["jobs",104.04,104.32],["not",104.32,104.56],["suitable",104.56,104.92],["for",104.92,105.2],["machines.",105.2,105.54]]},{"start":106.42,"end":113.76,"text":"Like, a machine might be able to diagnose your disease, but patients will always want to talk face-to-face with their doctor.","words":[["Like,",106.42,106.74],["a",107.16,107.26],["machine",107.26,107.58],["might",107.58,107.94],["be",107.94,108.14],["able",108.14,108.34],["to",108.34,108.48],["diagnose",108.48,108.92],["your",108.92,109.26],["disease,",109.26,109.76],["but",110.04,110.46],["patients",110.46,110.84],["will",110.84,111.12],["always",111.12,111.56],["want",111.56,111.8],["to",111.8,111.94],["talk",111.94,112.28],["face",112.28,112.62],["-to",112.62,112.86],["-face",112.86,113.04],["with",113.04,113.34],["their",113.34,113.46],["doctor.",113.46,113.76]]},{"start":114.66,"end":120.06,"text":"I suppose it's something to do with the fact that a human can empathize, but a machine can't.","words":[["I",114.66,114.92],["suppose",114.92,115.26],["it's",115.26,115.62],["something",115.62,115.86],["to",115.86,116.06],["do",116.06,116.2],["with",116.2,116.38],["the",116.38,116.48],["fact",116.48,116.78],["that",116.78,117.0],["a",117.0,117.08],["human",117.08,117.4],["can",117.4,117.62],["empathize,",117.62,118.48],["but",118.66,118.94],["a",118.94,119.04],["machine",119.04,119.38],["can't.",119.38,120.06]]},{"start":120.06,"end":127.82,"text":"Right. Now, there's that article called The Human Cloud. It describes the growing numbers","words":[["Right.",120.06,120.7],["Now,",121.54,122.04],["there's",122.42,123.0],["that",123.0,123.28],["article",123.28,123.78],["called",123.78,124.2],["The",124.2,124.6],["Human",124.6,125.08],["Cloud.",125.08,125.62],["It",126.14,126.4],["describes",126.4,126.74],["the",126.74,127.02],["growing",127.02,127.38],["numbers",127.38,127.82]]},{"start":127.82,"end":133.56,"text":"of people being employed as contractors to do online tasks at a distance. Well, that","words":[["of",127.82,128.1],["people",128.1,128.44],["being",128.44,128.72],["employed",128.72,129.14],["as",129.14,129.4],["contractors",129.4,129.98],["to",129.98,130.24],["do",130.24,130.38],["online",130.38,130.9],["tasks",130.9,131.44],["at",131.44,131.72],["a",131.72,131.86],["distance.",131.86,132.26],["Well,",132.92,133.32],["that",133.38,133.56]]},{"start":133.56,"end":138.92,"text":"could be good for the companies. They can choose the most expert people available, and","words":[["could",133.56,133.7],["be",133.7,133.84],["good",133.84,133.98],["for",133.98,134.1],["the",134.1,134.2],["companies.",134.2,134.64],["They",135.22,135.62],["can",135.62,135.86],["choose",135.86,136.26],["the",136.26,136.64],["most",136.64,136.86],["expert",136.86,137.4],["people",137.4,137.74],["available,",137.74,138.28],["and",138.6,138.92]]},{"start":138.92,"end":145.38,"text":"they get cheap labour and no costs except wages. But for the workers, it may mean","words":[["they",138.92,139.04],["get",139.04,139.2],["cheap",139.2,139.52],["labour",139.52,139.88],["and",139.88,140.42],["no",140.42,140.7],["costs",140.7,141.32],["except",141.32,141.92],["wages.",141.92,142.4],["But",142.98,143.28],["for",143.28,143.54],["the",143.54,143.64],["workers,",143.64,144.16],["it",144.54,144.68],["may",144.68,145.04],["mean",145.04,145.38]]},{"start":145.38,"end":151.58,"text":"less money. On the other hand, I love the idea of working from home at a time that suits.","words":[["less",145.38,145.7],["money.",145.7,146.18],["On",146.98,147.38],["the",147.38,147.52],["other",147.52,147.7],["hand,",147.7,148.04],["I",148.42,148.6],["love",148.6,148.9],["the",148.9,149.12],["idea",149.12,149.42],["of",149.42,149.62],["working",149.62,149.88],["from",149.88,150.12],["home",150.12,150.5],["at",150.5,150.66],["a",150.66,150.78],["time",150.78,151.06],["that",151.06,151.24],["suits.",151.24,151.58]]},{"start":152.3,"end":153.7,"text":"It's certainly controversial.","words":[["It's",152.3,152.58],["certainly",152.58,152.94],["controversial.",152.94,153.7]]},{"start":154.8,"end":160.6,"text":"Another article was the one looking at how employers will use technology to record what their employees","words":[["Another",154.8,155.06],["article",155.06,155.58],["was",155.58,155.82],["the",155.82,155.98],["one",155.98,156.16],["looking",156.16,156.44],["at",156.44,156.72],["how",156.72,157.04],["employers",157.04,157.8],["will",157.8,158.16],["use",158.16,158.38],["technology",158.38,158.94],["to",158.94,159.18],["record",159.18,159.6],["what",159.6,159.84],["their",159.84,160.02],["employees",160.02,160.6]]},{"start":160.6,"end":161.18,"text":"are doing.","words":[["are",160.6,160.9],["doing.",160.9,161.18]]},{"start":161.5,"end":167.04,"text":"So awful. Cameras in the workplace checking on where you are, software that tells your","words":[["So",161.5,161.9],["awful.",161.9,162.48],["Cameras",163.14,163.66],["in",163.66,163.88],["the",163.88,163.96],["workplace",163.96,164.34],["checking",164.34,164.8],["on",164.8,165.04],["where",165.04,165.3],["you",165.3,165.5],["are,",165.5,165.76],["software",166.08,166.46],["that",166.46,166.66],["tells",166.66,166.86],["your",166.86,167.04]]},{"start":167.04,"end":168.62,"text":"boss who you've been emailing.","words":[["boss",167.04,167.24],["who",167.24,167.54],["you've",167.54,167.76],["been",167.76,167.9],["emailing.",167.9,168.62]]},{"start":168.74,"end":173.28,"text":"When we talk about this, I want to make clear how this affects people's personal","words":[["When",168.74,169.14],["we",169.14,169.28],["talk",169.28,169.54],["about",169.54,169.8],["this,",169.8,170.12],["I",170.42,170.68],["want",170.68,170.84],["to",170.84,171.0],["make",171.0,171.18],["clear",171.18,171.66],["how",171.66,171.88],["this",171.88,172.02],["affects",172.02,172.34],["people's",172.34,172.84],["personal",172.84,173.28]]},{"start":173.28,"end":179.46,"text":"privacy. Did you read how some companies are tracking the health of their employees? Surely","words":[["privacy.",173.28,173.84],["Did",174.68,175.18],["you",175.18,175.38],["read",175.38,175.62],["how",175.62,175.82],["some",175.82,176.08],["companies",176.08,176.56],["are",176.56,176.88],["tracking",176.88,177.2],["the",177.2,177.4],["health",177.4,177.7],["of",177.7,177.88],["their",177.88,178.02],["employees?",178.02,178.4],["Surely",178.96,179.46]]},{"start":179.46,"end":186.02,"text":"workers won't accept that. Yes, I'd be very surprised if this became common. Too many employees would","words":[["workers",179.46,179.84],["won't",179.84,180.12],["accept",180.12,180.4],["that.",180.4,180.76],["Yes,",181.32,181.7],["I'd",181.86,182.04],["be",182.04,182.14],["very",182.14,182.56],["surprised",182.56,183.06],["if",183.06,183.32],["this",183.32,183.48],["became",183.48,183.76],["common.",183.76,184.2],["Too",184.74,184.94],["many",184.94,185.22],["employees",185.22,185.78],["would",185.78,186.02]]},{"start":186.02,"end":196.2,"text":"refuse. Before you hear the rest of the discussion, you have some time to look at questions 25 to 30.","words":[["refuse.",186.02,186.4],["Before",190.24,190.58],["you",190.58,190.84],["hear",190.84,191.12],["the",191.12,191.32],["rest",191.32,191.6],["of",191.6,191.74],["the",191.74,191.8],["discussion,",191.8,192.22],["you",192.82,193.04],["have",193.04,193.22],["some",193.22,193.42],["time",193.42,193.84],["to",193.84,194.1],["look",194.1,194.24],["at",194.24,194.38],["questions",194.38,194.68],["25",194.68,195.64],["to",195.64,195.86],["30.",195.86,196.2]]},{"start":226.76,"end":236.77,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 25 to 30. Okay, there's some aspects of the presentation","words":[["Now",226.76,227.02],["listen",227.02,227.3],["and",227.3,227.72],["answer",227.72,228.12],["questions",228.12,228.52],["25",228.52,229.48],["to",229.48,229.74],["30.",229.74,230.12],["Okay,",233.77,234.23],["there's",234.77,235.35],["some",235.35,235.57],["aspects",235.57,235.99],["of",235.99,236.19],["the",236.19,236.31],["presentation",236.31,236.77]]},{"start":236.77,"end":238.25,"text":"we still need to think about.","words":[["we",236.77,237.19],["still",237.19,237.47],["need",237.47,237.65],["to",237.65,237.79],["think",237.79,237.99],["about.",237.99,238.25]]},{"start":238.81,"end":240.57,"text":"Yes, there are a few issues.","words":[["Yes,",238.81,239.31],["there",239.55,239.71],["are",239.71,239.87],["a",239.87,240.03],["few",240.03,240.21],["issues.",240.21,240.57]]},{"start":241.45,"end":243.07,"text":"Let's go through them one by one.","words":[["Let's",241.45,241.77],["go",241.77,241.89],["through",241.89,242.11],["them",242.11,242.33],["one",242.33,242.57],["by",242.57,242.77],["one.",242.77,243.07]]},{"start":243.57,"end":243.95,"text":"OK.","words":[["OK.",243.57,243.95]]},{"start":244.87,"end":246.43,"text":"What about the introduction then?","words":[["What",244.87,245.23],["about",245.23,245.43],["the",245.43,245.61],["introduction",245.61,246.09],["then?",246.09,246.43]]},{"start":246.95,"end":249.11,"text":"Well, we've sorted out the content.","words":[["Well,",246.95,247.33],["we've",247.63,247.97],["sorted",247.97,248.23],["out",248.23,248.49],["the",248.49,248.63],["content.",248.63,249.11]]},{"start":249.43,"end":250.75,"text":"Well, your editing has helped.","words":[["Well,",249.43,249.59],["your",249.63,249.75],["editing",249.75,250.09],["has",250.09,250.43],["helped.",250.43,250.75]]},{"start":251.49,"end":254.07,"text":"But don't you think you ought to deliver it rather than me?","words":[["But",251.49,251.69],["don't",251.69,251.97],["you",251.97,252.11],["think",252.11,252.35],["you",252.35,252.65],["ought",252.65,252.79],["to",252.79,252.91],["deliver",252.91,253.19],["it",253.19,253.39],["rather",253.39,253.67],["than",253.67,253.93],["me?",253.93,254.07]]},{"start":254.53,"end":255.43,"text":"It's mainly your work.","words":[["It's",254.53,254.69],["mainly",254.69,254.89],["your",254.89,255.17],["work.",255.17,255.43]]},{"start":255.99,"end":258.19,"text":"OK, so let's do it that way then.","words":[["OK,",255.99,256.33],["so",256.61,256.95],["let's",256.95,257.37],["do",257.37,257.49],["it",257.49,257.59],["that",257.59,257.77],["way",257.77,257.97],["then.",257.97,258.19]]},{"start":258.63,"end":258.85,"text":"Good.","words":[["Good.",258.63,258.85]]},{"start":259.53,"end":261.35,"text":"What about the researcher profiles?","words":[["What",259.53,259.81],["about",259.81,260.07],["the",260.07,260.29],["researcher",260.29,260.81],["profiles?",260.81,261.35]]},{"start":262.29,"end":264.51,"text":"Kathy Bryson and Alex Coburn's backgrounds?","words":[["Kathy",262.29,262.77],["Bryson",262.77,263.25],["and",263.25,263.39],["Alex",263.39,263.65],["Coburn's",263.65,264.15],["backgrounds?",264.15,264.51]]},{"start":264.51,"end":268.57,"text":"I doubt we'll have time to look at them properly during the presentation.","words":[["I",264.51,265.47],["doubt",265.47,265.67],["we'll",265.67,265.91],["have",265.91,266.05],["time",266.05,266.37],["to",266.37,266.65],["look",266.65,266.85],["at",266.85,266.97],["them",266.97,267.11],["properly",267.11,267.47],["during",267.47,267.83],["the",267.83,267.99],["presentation.",267.99,268.57]]},{"start":269.23,"end":273.77,"text":"I reckon we should just attach that bit to the written report we're given to the tutor.","words":[["I",269.23,269.53],["reckon",269.53,269.79],["we",269.79,269.99],["should",269.99,270.15],["just",270.15,270.41],["attach",270.41,270.79],["that",270.79,271.03],["bit",271.03,271.35],["to",271.35,271.65],["the",271.65,271.91],["written",271.91,272.33],["report",272.33,272.81],["we're",272.81,273.05],["given",273.05,273.19],["to",273.19,273.41],["the",273.41,273.53],["tutor.",273.53,273.77]]},{"start":274.53,"end":275.79,"text":"So, cut it?","words":[["So,",274.53,275.05],["cut",275.33,275.57],["it?",275.57,275.79]]},{"start":276.21,"end":279.53,"text":"Let's rehearse the whole presentation and see if it's necessary.","words":[["Let's",276.21,276.63],["rehearse",276.63,277.07],["the",277.07,277.23],["whole",277.23,277.53],["presentation",277.53,278.27],["and",278.27,278.61],["see",278.61,278.81],["if",278.81,278.91],["it's",278.91,279.03],["necessary.",279.03,279.53]]},{"start":280.47,"end":282.09,"text":"What about the section on automation?","words":[["What",280.47,280.87],["about",280.87,281.03],["the",281.03,281.17],["section",281.17,281.45],["on",281.45,281.67],["automation?",281.67,282.09]]},{"start":282.83,"end":283.85,"text":"Aren't you happy with it?","words":[["Aren't",282.83,283.11],["you",283.11,283.21],["happy",283.21,283.45],["with",283.45,283.69],["it?",283.69,283.85]]},{"start":284.37,"end":288.69,"text":"I'm thinking I haven't really given equal attention to the pros and cons.","words":[["I'm",284.37,284.63],["thinking",284.63,285.01],["I",285.01,285.31],["haven't",285.31,285.73],["really",285.73,286.05],["given",286.05,286.35],["equal",286.35,286.79],["attention",286.79,287.27],["to",287.27,287.59],["the",287.59,287.75],["pros",287.75,288.09],["and",288.09,288.35],["cons.",288.35,288.69]]},{"start":289.61,"end":290.75,"text":"I should start again.","words":[["I",289.61,290.07],["should",290.07,290.19],["start",290.19,290.41],["again.",290.41,290.75]]},{"start":291.41,"end":293.87,"text":"Well, let's have a bit more of a think about it.","words":[["Well,",291.41,291.85],["let's",292.07,292.45],["have",292.45,292.53],["a",292.53,292.65],["bit",292.65,292.77],["more",292.77,292.97],["of",292.97,293.09],["a",293.09,293.19],["think",293.19,293.33],["about",293.33,293.63],["it.",293.63,293.87]]},{"start":293.87,"end":296.79,"text":"you don't want to rush into a big job like that.","words":[["you",293.87,294.51],["don't",294.51,294.79],["want",294.79,294.93],["to",294.93,295.01],["rush",295.01,295.25],["into",295.25,295.53],["a",295.53,295.73],["big",295.73,295.91],["job",295.91,296.23],["like",296.23,296.45],["that.",296.45,296.79]]},{"start":297.59,"end":300.57,"text":"Another thing is a section on workplace structure.","words":[["Another",297.59,298.15],["thing",298.15,298.55],["is",298.55,298.93],["a",298.93,299.07],["section",299.07,299.35],["on",299.35,299.57],["workplace",299.57,299.97],["structure.",299.97,300.57]]},{"start":301.31,"end":303.89,"text":"I think we've got some good points, but...","words":[["I",301.31,301.61],["think",301.61,301.83],["we've",301.83,302.09],["got",302.09,302.23],["some",302.23,302.43],["good",302.43,302.73],["points,",302.73,303.31],["but...",303.47,303.89]]},{"start":303.89,"end":307.67,"text":"We're only using one particular company as a case study.","words":[["We're",303.89,304.23],["only",304.23,304.67],["using",304.67,305.13],["one",305.13,305.45],["particular",305.45,305.95],["company",305.95,306.57],["as",306.57,306.91],["a",306.91,307.05],["case",307.05,307.31],["study.",307.31,307.67]]},{"start":308.45,"end":311.79,"text":"We need to source some other situations as supporting material.","words":[["We",308.45,308.71],["need",308.71,308.89],["to",308.89,309.05],["source",309.05,309.27],["some",309.27,309.53],["other",309.53,309.79],["situations",309.79,310.45],["as",310.45,310.67],["supporting",310.67,311.09],["material.",311.09,311.79]]},{"start":312.53,"end":315.61,"text":"So perhaps we could both do a search and compare notes.","words":[["So",312.53,312.79],["perhaps",312.79,313.21],["we",313.21,313.55],["could",313.55,313.67],["both",313.67,313.89],["do",313.89,314.09],["a",314.09,314.19],["search",314.19,314.59],["and",314.59,314.99],["compare",314.99,315.27],["notes.",315.27,315.61]]},{"start":315.79,"end":317.79,"text":"And choose the most interesting cases.","words":[["And",315.79,315.93],["choose",315.93,316.23],["the",316.23,316.47],["most",316.47,316.75],["interesting",316.75,317.29],["cases.",317.29,317.79]]},{"start":318.91,"end":322.83,"text":"And the section on tracking technology. Are we happy with that?","words":[["And",318.91,319.25],["the",319.25,319.39],["section",319.39,319.65],["on",319.65,319.85],["tracking",319.85,320.39],["technology.",320.39,321.13],["Are",321.79,322.03],["we",322.03,322.17],["happy",322.17,322.39],["with",322.39,322.59],["that?",322.59,322.83]]},{"start":322.83,"end":325.29,"text":"It would definitely benefit from some photos.","words":[["It",322.83,323.57],["would",323.57,323.69],["definitely",323.69,324.07],["benefit",324.07,324.41],["from",324.41,324.69],["some",324.69,324.89],["photos.",324.89,325.29]]},{"start":325.99,"end":329.55,"text":"Hang on, there's no point using images just for decoration.","words":[["Hang",325.99,326.21],["on,",326.21,326.47],["there's",327.09,327.41],["no",327.41,327.59],["point",327.59,327.83],["using",327.83,328.11],["images",328.11,328.55],["just",328.55,328.85],["for",328.85,329.05],["decoration.",329.05,329.55]]},{"start":330.27,"end":333.23,"text":"We need to think about whether they'd serve any real purpose.","words":[["We",330.27,330.49],["need",330.49,330.67],["to",330.67,330.83],["think",330.83,330.99],["about",330.99,331.25],["whether",331.25,331.61],["they'd",331.61,331.93],["serve",331.93,332.19],["any",332.19,332.49],["real",332.49,332.79],["purpose.",332.79,333.23]]},{"start":333.77,"end":337.39,"text":"Fair enough. Let's make a decision on that at a later stage.","words":[["Fair",333.77,334.09],["enough.",334.09,334.33],["Let's",335.09,335.43],["make",335.43,335.57],["a",335.57,335.67],["decision",335.67,336.01],["on",336.01,336.23],["that",336.23,336.41],["at",336.41,336.59],["a",336.59,336.73],["later",336.73,336.93],["stage.",336.93,337.39]]},{"start":338.07,"end":340.25,"text":"And that interview we did with the company manager.","words":[["And",338.07,338.43],["that",338.43,338.61],["interview",338.61,338.97],["we",338.97,339.17],["did",339.17,339.33],["with",339.33,339.45],["the",339.45,339.57],["company",339.57,339.83],["manager.",339.83,340.25]]},{"start":340.69,"end":343.13,"text":"Yes, we were lucky she gave us her time.","words":[["Yes,",340.69,341.13],["we",341.37,341.51],["were",341.51,341.65],["lucky",341.65,341.95],["she",341.95,342.15],["gave",342.15,342.33],["us",342.33,342.55],["her",342.55,342.71],["time.",342.71,343.13]]},{"start":343.59,"end":347.73,"text":"But I just want to be sure we wrote everything down accurately.","words":[["But",343.59,343.83],["I",343.83,343.97],["just",343.97,344.35],["want",344.35,344.85],["to",344.85,345.13],["be",345.13,345.31],["sure",345.31,345.73],["we",345.73,345.97],["wrote",345.97,346.19],["everything",346.19,346.73],["down",346.73,347.07],["accurately.",347.07,347.73]]},{"start":348.75,"end":350.77,"text":"I wouldn't like to misrepresent her views.","words":[["I",348.75,349.11],["wouldn't",349.11,349.31],["like",349.31,349.51],["to",349.51,349.71],["misrepresent",349.71,350.27],["her",350.27,350.49],["views.",350.49,350.77]]},{"start":351.67,"end":356.99,"text":"Maybe I should type up that section and send it to her so she can confirm whether or not it's correct.","words":[["Maybe",351.67,352.21],["I",352.21,352.53],["should",352.53,352.75],["type",352.75,353.07],["up",353.07,353.27],["that",353.27,353.49],["section",353.49,353.89],["and",353.89,354.09],["send",354.09,354.33],["it",354.33,354.45],["to",354.45,354.63],["her",354.63,354.81],["so",354.81,355.25],["she",355.25,355.43],["can",355.43,355.59],["confirm",355.59,355.97],["whether",355.97,356.23],["or",356.23,356.41],["not",356.41,356.49],["it's",356.49,356.69],["correct.",356.69,356.99]]},{"start":357.41,"end":359.75,"text":"Yes, that's a good idea. Go ahead.","words":[["Yes,",357.41,357.77],["that's",358.01,358.31],["a",358.31,358.37],["good",358.37,358.53],["idea.",358.53,358.93],["Go",359.45,359.53],["ahead.",359.53,359.75]]},{"start":360.07,"end":360.97,"text":"Sounds like a plan.","words":[["Sounds",360.07,360.41],["like",360.41,360.63],["a",360.63,360.71],["plan.",360.71,360.97]]},{"start":361.59,"end":363.19,"text":"Okay, and we...","words":[["Okay,",361.59,361.95],["and",362.19,362.49],["we...",362.49,363.19]]},{"start":365.88,"end":372.5,"text":"That is the end of Part 3. You now have 30 seconds to check your answers to Part 3.","words":[["That",365.88,366.22],["is",366.22,366.36],["the",366.36,366.52],["end",366.52,366.86],["of",366.86,367.04],["Part",367.04,367.24],["3.",367.24,367.62],["You",368.58,368.96],["now",368.96,369.2],["have",369.2,369.56],["30",369.56,369.92],["seconds",369.92,370.4],["to",370.4,370.76],["check",370.76,371.06],["your",371.06,371.24],["answers",371.24,371.62],["to",371.62,371.9],["Part",371.9,372.08],["3.",372.08,372.5]]}]}